// AppleTalk phase, Task 8, runerr fixture: every `open` is asynchronous,
// the AppleTalk forms included -- `opened` fires on a later pump pass
// (spec %4.1). So a `send` on the very next line is a send on a
// connection that is not open yet, which is a contract violation and a
// runtime error (spec %4.5), exactly as it is for the serial transport.
var link: connection

on App.startCLI(args: list of string) {
    link.open(appletalk "Nobody:ClarusNone")
    link.send("hello")
}
